ttps://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/RPPINFRA_27082026170207_SDAT_Termination-SE_Intimation.pdf","mcap":275.8,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/RPPINFRA_27082026170207_SDAT_Termination-SE_Intimation.pdf"},{"symbol":"INDOCO","ticker":"INDOCO","company":"Indoco Remedies Ltd","event_type":"divestment","quantum":"Rs 64.00 cr; ~2.9% of mcap","headline":"executes the **Deed of Conveyance for the sale of a plot of land for Rs 64 crore**, a completed disposal the company says does not affect its business operations","amount_rs":"640000000","notability_pct":"2.90","marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/fae0fee0-f28f-4407-a5e8-9a89cbefded7.pdf","mcap":2246.1,"doc":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/fae0fee0-f28f-4407-a5e8-9a89cbefded7.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**Tejas Networks** — a **Letter of Intent worth Rs 1,537 crore from Tata Consultancy Services** for supply of RAN equipment, accessories and installation at sites; the detailed purchase order is to follow, and the filing refers back to the companies' communication of 21 May 2025 _(~17.1% of mcap)_.","**Skipper** — **fresh orders of Rs 1,305 crore** for power transmission and distribution projects across India and export markets, covering transmission lines and substations _(~21.1% of mcap)_.","**Capacit'e Infraprojects** — a **Rs 741 crore Letter of Intent excluding GST from Mahindra Lifespace Developers** for core-and-shell construction work, received in the normal course of business _(~38.5% of mcap)_.","**Om Power Transmission** — a **Rs 12.78 crore letter of intent including GST from Gujarat Energy Transmission Corporation** for laying, erection, testing and commissioning of 66kV underground cable over 24 months _(~2.1% of mcap)_.","**Viviana Power Tech** — a **Rs 9.74 crore turnkey contract including taxes from Gujarat Energy Transmission Corporation**, for laying, erection, testing and commissioning of 66kV XLPE cable in the Rajkot Zone over 24 months _(~1.3% of mcap)_.","**Winsol Engineers** — a Letter of Intent with an **aggregate order value of Rs 8.25 crore** _(~6.3% of mcap)_.","**TechD Cybersecurity** — an order worth **Rs 4.89 crore** _(~1.2% of mcap; SME)_.","**GK Energy** — issues the press release for the **Rs 454.50 crore rooftop-solar empanelment** covering 1,00,000 households, which was published as a top mover in yesterday's digest; the release adds that cumulative allocation now exceeds Rs 1,092 crore."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Hindustan Copper** — gives **prior intimation of a board meeting to consider raising funds by a Qualified Institutions Placement** of up to 9,69,76,680 equity shares, a stage below approval.","**Balaji Phosphates** — board approves a preferential issue of warrants to promoter-group entity Divya Jyoti Agritech and promoters Mohit Airen and Alok Gupta **aggregating up to Rs 25 crore** _(~11.9% of mcap, a ceiling)_; a registered valuer was appointed the same day and shareholders have still to approve.","**Jindal Capital** — board approves raising **up to Rs 20 crore by a rights issue**; the issue price, entitlement ratio and record date are all still to be determined _(~84% of mcap, a ceiling)_.","**Leading Leasing Finance** — board approves issuing up to **35,71,42,856 equity shares at Rs 1.40** to non-promoters **by converting their existing unsecured loans**, so no new cash arrives; authorised capital goes from Rs 60 crore to Rs 164 crore, subject to the AGM (Rs 50.00 crore is our multiplication of the stated count and price).","**Anondita Medicare** — board resolves to issue equity shares on a rights basis in a 9,58,000 : 1,80,86,618 ratio, a day after receiving NSE's in-principle approval.","**Manas Polymers and Energies** — submits the final Letter of Offer for its rights issue.","**Jupiter Infomedia** — board resolves to **withdraw** its proposed preferential issue of warrants."],"equity_allotments":["**Zee Entertainment** — allots **2,40,59,266 fully convertible warrants at Rs 126 each** to promoter-group entity Sunbright Mauritius Investments and receives the 25% subscription price of **Rs 75.78 crore**; these are NEW warrants, not a past conversion, issued the day the Securities Appellate Tribunal granted a one-working-day extension _(~0.8% of mcap)_.","**Neetu Yoshi** — allots **26,42,400 warrants at Rs 104 each** on a preferential basis, convertible into an equal number of Rs 5 equity shares (new warrants; the filing states the count and price, and Rs 27.48 crore is our multiplication of the two)."],"m_and_a":["**Hero MotoCorp** — buys additional **Ather Energy shares for up to Rs 1,758 crore in cash** from an existing shareholder, taking its fully diluted stake from 29.88% to up to about 32.8%, for completion by 3 September _(~1.6% of mcap)_.","**Tata Steel** — subscribes **USD 140 million (Rs 1,340.16 crore at the filing's own RBI rate)** to equity of T Steel Holdings Pte Ltd, **its own wholly owned subsidiary**, a tranche under the March 2026 board approval of up to USD 2 billion _(~0.6% of mcap)_.","**Adani Power** — signs an agreement to sell its **entire stake in Coastal Ideal Power for a consideration of Rs 535.69 crore**, subject to adjustments on closing _(~0.1% of mcap)_.","**Indoco Remedies** — executes the **Deed of Conveyance for the sale of a plot of land for Rs 64 crore**, which it says neither affects business operations nor constitutes the sale of an undertaking _(~2.9% of mcap)_.","**Mahindra Lifespace Developers** — approves the **sale of its entire equity and compulsorily convertible stake in associate companies for Rs 80 crore** _(~1.0% of mcap)_; separately it is the counterparty awarding Capacit'e its Rs 741 crore construction order.","**Balaji Phosphates** — grants in-principle approval to acquire the business undertakings of two related parties, **Chatak Agro (India) for up to Rs 35 crore** by share swap and cash and **Divya Jyoti Agritech for up to Rs 15 crore**, with the valuation and swap ratio still to be set _(~16.7% and ~7.2% of mcap, both ceilings)_.","**GACM Technologies** — signs a **Memorandum of Understanding with Winfluential Private Limited** for a mandate with an estimated consideration of **Rs 25 crore** _(~22.9% of mcap; an MoU, not a definitive agreement)_.","**Osel Devices** — approves borrowing or investing an **aggregate not exceeding Rs 50 crore during FY 2026-27**, subject to shareholders, alongside raising authorised capital from Rs 20 crore to Rs 25 crore _(~7.2% of mcap, a ceiling)_.","**Texmaco Rail & Engineering** — signs a Memorandum of Understanding with Bochumer Verein Verkehrstechnik of Germany.","**Systematix Corporate Services** — subscribes **Rs 2.70 crore** to the rights issue of Systematix Wealth & Asset Services, its own wholly owned subsidiary; an intra-group transfer that changes no external holding."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — **19 companies filed** results or earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here."],"distress_risk":["**R.P.P. Infra Projects** — the Sports Development Authority of Tamil Nadu has **terminated its Rs 205.89 crore Global Sports City work order**, awarded in February, having decided to redesign the project on a larger scale. The company had commenced work, incurred substantial expenditure, and is evaluating its remedies _(~72.6% of mcap)_.","**Nila Infrastructures** — the Gujarat Housing Board has **cancelled the Nirmal Apartment redevelopment**, awarded in October 2023 for 300 HIG residential units and 18 commercial shops, and is returning the earnest-money deposit. The filing's annexure is a scan we could not read reliably, so no value is stated here.","**RailTel** — an arbitral tribunal awards it about **Rs 13 crore of its Rs 94 crore claim** against Rajcomp Info Services and allows **Rs 5 crore of Rajcomp's Rs 313 crore counter-claim**, leaving Rajcomp to pay a net Rs 8 crore with interest and GST."],"other_notable":["**Great Eastern Shipping** — board approves a **buyback of up to Rs 900 crore** at a maximum price of Rs 1,530 a share, from all shareholders other than the promoter group _(~4.7% of mcap)_."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","other_notable":"Other notable"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"label":"TEJASNET","ticker":"TEJASNET","company":"Tejas Networks Limited","isin":"INE010J01012","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TEJASNET_27082026183323_Intimation-Letter_of_Intent_from_TCS.pdf","mcap":9955.2},{"label":"SKIPPER","ticker":"SKIPPER","company":"Skipper Limited","isin":"INE439E01022","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/skipper_27082026114953_Press_Release-Order.pdf","mcap":6110.4},{"label":"CAPACITE","ticker":"CAPACITE","company":"Capacit'e Infraprojects Limited","isin":"INE264T01014","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/CAPACITE_27082026112043_WorkOrderMahindra.pdf","mcap":1810.5},{"label":"OMPOWER","ticker":"OMPOWER","company":"Om Power Transmission Ltd","isin":"INE25E901019","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/d3fcb4de-0c66-4af7-bae0-47188815bed9.pdf","mcap":596.4},{"label":"VIVIANA","ticker":"VIVIANA","company":"Viviana Power Tech Limited","isin":"INE0MEG01014","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/VIVIANA_27082026145941_VIVIANA__Intimation_of_Receiving_Order_GETCO_27082026.pdf","mcap":736.6},{"label":"WINSOL","ticker":"WINSOL","company":"Winsol Engineers Limited","isin":"INE0S3D01016","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/WINSOL_27082026173753_Reg.pdf","mcap":131.6},{"label":"TECHD","ticker":"TECHD","company":"TechD Cybe